---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { lineMessageUrl, lineMessages } from '../../lib/line';

const lineUrl = lineMessageUrl(lineMessages.awardLishan);
---

<Base
  title="梨山農會春茶比賽三星獎｜88茶葉"
  description="2026 梨山農會春茶比賽三星獎，300g 手採青心烏龍認證禮盒，每盒 NT$1,800，2盒 NT$3,600 免運。"
  lineMessage={lineMessages.awardLishan}
>
  <section class="award-hero">
    <div class="award-shell">
      <div class="award-image">
        <img src="/images/lishan-competition-3star-2026.jpg" alt="2026 梨山農會春茶比賽三星獎禮盒與農會認證封條" loading="eager" />
        <span class="award-seal">梨山農會<br/>三星獎</span>
      </div>
      <div class="award-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">2026 春茶｜本期主打</p>
        <h1>梨山農會春茶<br/>比賽三星獎</h1>
        <p class="lead">手採青心烏龍春茶，香氣乾淨清亮，入口甘醇、喉韻深。附農會認證封條與提袋，自飲有品質，送禮也體面。</p>
        <div class="price-block">
          <span>300g（半斤）禮盒</span>
          <strong>NT$1,800／盒</strong>
          <p>2盒 NT$3,600 免運｜1盒運費另計</p>
        </div>
        <a href={lineUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="primary-cta">用 LINE 詢問／訂購</a>
        <p class="cta-note">開啟 LINE 後會帶入商品名稱，送出即可接續詢問。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="decision-section">
    <div class="content-shell">
      <header class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">先看是否適合您</p>
        <h2>重視茶質，也重視送禮辨識度</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="fit-grid">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>自己品飲</h3><p>喜歡清香乾淨、入口甘醇，而且希望喉韻較深的茶友。</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h3>送長輩</h3><p>農會比賽獎項與認證封條，茶品來歷清楚，禮盒附提袋。</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h3>送客戶</h3><p>300g 禮盒份量明確，外盒與封條適合正式送禮情境。</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="facts-section">
    <div class="content-shell facts-layout">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">茶品資訊</p>
        <h2>一眼看懂規格與優惠</h2>
      </div>
      <dl class="facts-list">
        <div><dt>茶區</dt><dd>台灣梨山茶區</dd></div>
        <div><dt>品種</dt><dd>手採青心烏龍春茶</dd></div>
        <div><dt>規格</dt><dd>300g（半斤）禮盒</dd></div>
        <div><dt>包裝</dt><dd>提袋、農會認證封條</dd></div>
        <div><dt>優惠</dt><dd>每盒 NT$1,800；2盒 NT$3,600 免運</dd></div>
        <div><dt>期限</dt><dd>優惠至 2026/9/15</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="order-section">
    <div class="content-shell order-card">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">LINE 專人承接</p>
        <h2>先問清楚，再決定買幾盒</h2>
        <p>加入 LINE 後可先選「了解口感、訂1盒、訂2盒免運」。資料齊全時，客服會整理完整訂單，等您確認後才成立。</p>
      </div>
      <a href={lineUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="primary-cta">開啟 LINE 詢問</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="content-shell">
      <header class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">購買前常見問題</p>
        <h2>規格、運費與訂購方式</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="faq-grid">
        <article><h3>一盒是否免運？</h3><p>一盒運費另計；2盒合計 NT$3,600 免運。實際配送資訊會在成立訂單前完整核對。</p></article>
        <article><h3>怎麼完成訂購？</h3><p>從本頁開啟 LINE，選擇數量並提供必要收件資料。客服回顯品項、金額與收件資訊後，請回覆「確認下單」。</p></article>
        <article><h3>什麼時候出貨？</h3><p>出貨時間會依訂單與作業狀態核實後通知，不會在資料尚未確認前先承諾日期。</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .award-hero { padding: 8rem 1.5rem 5rem; background: #18281d; color: white; }
  .award-shell, .content-shell { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .award-shell { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.08fr) minmax(0, .92fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem); align-items: center; }
  .award-image { position: relative; background: #f5efe6; padding: clamp(.8rem, 2vw, 1.3rem); }
  .award-image img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: cover; }
  .award-seal { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 0; transform: translate(20%, 28%); width: 92px; height: 92px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; text-align: center; line-height: 1.35; background: #c8a96e; color: #1a1612; border: 5px solid #18281d; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-weight: 700; }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--gold); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .18em; margin-bottom: .8rem; }
  .award-copy h1 { font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.7rem); margin-bottom: 1.3rem; }
  .lead { color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.9; }
  .price-block { margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1.4rem 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,.35); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200,169,110,.35); }
  .price-block span, .price-block strong { display: block; }
  .price-block span { font-size: .9rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.65); }
  .price-block strong { color: var(--gold-light); font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.8rem; margin: .2rem 0; }
  .price-block p, .cta-note { color: rgba(255,255,255,.62); font-size: .85rem; }
  .primary-cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 50px; padding: .85rem 1.6rem; background: #06c755; color: #102617 !important; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 3px; }
  .primary-cta:hover { background: #20da6d; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .cta-note { margin-top: .65rem; }
  .decision-section, .faq-section { background: var(--parchment); }
  .content-shell { padding: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem) 0; }
  .section-heading { max-width: 720px; margin-bottom: 2.4rem; }
  .section-heading h2, .facts-layout h2, .order-card h2 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 2.35rem); }
  .fit-grid, .faq-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  .fit-grid article, .faq-grid article { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--cream); padding: 1.8rem; }
  .fit-grid span { color: var(--gold-dark); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .15em; }
  .fit-grid h3, .faq-grid h3 { margin: .6rem 0; font-size: 1.12rem; }
  .fit-grid p, .faq-grid p, .order-card p { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: .95rem; }
  .facts-section { background: var(--parchment-warm); }
  .facts-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr; gap: 4rem; }
  .facts-list { background: white; border-top: 3px solid var(--gold); padding: .6rem 1.6rem; }
  .facts-list div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 7rem 1fr; gap: 1rem; padding: 1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cream); }
  .facts-list div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .facts-list dt { color: var(--ink-muted); }
  .facts-list dd { font-weight: 600; }
  .order-section { background: white; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
  .order-card { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; }
  .order-card > div { max-width: 670px; }
  .faq-section { padding: 0 1.5rem; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .award-hero { padding-top: 6.7rem; }
    .award-shell, .facts-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .award-seal { right: .5rem; transform: translateY(28%); width: 78px; height: 78px; font-size: .85rem; }
    .fit-grid, .faq-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .facts-layout { gap: 1.5rem; }
    .facts-list div { grid-template-columns: 5rem 1fr; }
    .order-card { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    .order-card .primary-cta { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
